WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.670
Start with five.

2
00:00:01.720 --> 00:00:04.170
Now take away negative three.

3
00:00:04.220 --> 00:00:07.450
Taking away usually
makes a number smaller.

4
00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:10.770
Take sweets out of a bag,
and there are fewer left.

5
00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:13.590
So will the answer be
smaller than five?

6
00:00:13.640 --> 00:00:16.890
Or can taking away ever
make a number bigger?

7
00:00:16.940 --> 00:00:19.810
In this mission, you'll learn
the sign rules for negative

8
00:00:19.860 --> 00:00:20.470
numbers.

9
00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:24.170
You'll use BIDMAS to do
calculations in the right order.

10
00:00:24.220 --> 00:00:27.570
You'll work with squares,
cubes and roots.

11
00:00:27.620 --> 00:00:31.670
And you'll write huge and tiny
numbers in standard form.

12
00:00:31.720 --> 00:00:35.070
Your mission: find out whether
taking away can make a number

13
00:00:35.120 --> 00:00:36.270
bigger.
